283
00:17:33,827 --> 00:17:35,227
Lo juro.

284
00:17:41,167 --> 00:17:44,787
De acuerdo.

285
00:17:44,838 --> 00:17:46,171
Cuando nos marchemos,

286
00:17:46,206 --> 00:17:47,539
¿no va a ir

287
00:17:47,573 --> 00:17:51,176
